when we put it on an image that is generated by a&nbsp;
camera. Now this complete concept of homogeneous&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:44.880 --> 01:02:49.040
Transformations is very fundamental to&nbsp;
robotics as well as computer vision.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:49.680 --> 01:02:57.120
It is used in self driving cars, mobile robots,&nbsp;
