they have considerable height in order for&nbsp;
the inverse perspective mapping to work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:12.080 --> 01:54:18.400
Although we can get a top view of the environment&nbsp;
by applying and inverse perspective mapping,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:18.400 --> 01:54:23.520
however, the results that we get from&nbsp;
that technique are not really accurate&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:54:23.520 --> 01:54:29.760
and useful for our task. Hence, we need&nbsp;
such complex architectures like unit SST&nbsp;&nbsp;

